{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">朝鮮5,000<span style=\"color: rgb(108, 108, 108); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">噸</span>級驅逐艦姜健號入列，領袖金正恩出席儀式。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">朝中社報道，姜健號的入列儀式周日在元山港舉行。朝鮮勞動黨領袖、國務委員長金正恩出席，女兒金主愛也有隨行。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.NK.DESTROYER.1300.GFX.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026YpKxkeMw6p1788760877.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.NK.DESTROYER.1300.GFX.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">他發表講話時提到，姜健號不但是朝鮮經濟、國防、科技力量的綜合體現，更是國家維護自身權益的意志及精神結晶。他強調，朝鮮海軍正實現核武裝化，核戰鬥系統多方位，進一步鞏固核戰爭威懾力量，又稱朝鮮正實施強化海軍重要計劃，將在8個月後公開展示成果。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.NK.DESTROYER.1300.GFX_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026mYRGscJh5O1788760900.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.NK.DESTROYER.1300.GFX_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">姜健號去年5月首次下水時出現艦體側傾、船尾擱淺等事故。當局大半個月後才將姜健號修復，並再舉行下水儀式。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-07T06:19:08.590428+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":255,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}